#: src/components/core/ExitInstallationDialog.tsx:51
msgid ""
"Configuration pre-scripts have been executed and may have modified your "
"system. You can reboot or shut down, but any changes made by these scripts "
"will not be undone."
msgstr ""
"Skrip prakonfigurasi telah dijalankan dan mungkin telah mengubah sistem "
"Anda. Anda dapat memulai ulang atau mematikan sistem, tetapi perubahan yang "
"dibuat oleh skrip tersebut tidak akan dibatalkan."

#: src/components/core/ExitInstallationDialog.tsx:56
msgid ""
"You can safely reboot or shut down the system. No changes have been made to "
"your disks, and your current installation setup will be canceled."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat memulai ulang atau mematikan sistem dengan aman. Tidak ada "
"perubahan pada disk Anda, dan pengaturan instalasi saat ini akan dibatalkan."

#: src/components/core/ExitInstallationDialog.tsx:73
#: src/components/core/InstallerOptionsMenu.tsx:167
msgid "Exit installation"
msgstr "Keluar dari instalasi"

#: src/components/core/ExitInstallationDialog.tsx:79
#: src/components/core/RebootButton.tsx:54
msgid "Reboot"
msgstr "Mulai ulang"

#: src/components/core/ExitInstallationDialog.tsx:82
msgid "Shut down"
msgstr "Matikan"

